# Amnesia Bridge: Anti-Thrashing Rule

1. Before installing new libraries, altering build configs, or refactoring architecture, check `.agents/FAILURE_GRAVEYARD.md` or run:
   `amnesia-bridge check "<intended approach>"`
2. If an approach is listed as a Dead End, DO NOT RETRY IT.
3. If an approach fails twice, immediately record it into `.agents/FAILURE_GRAVEYARD.md` using:
   `amnesia-bridge record -c "<Category>" -a "<Attempt>" -e "<Error>" -r "<Forbidden Rule>"`
